  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2904.01 SO2 Budget",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-11-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2904.01 SO2 Budget.\n\n(a) Subject to (b), below, the annual SO2 budget shall be determined by multiplying the combined baseline power generation from the affected sources by 3.0 pounds per MWh.\n\n(b) The annual SO2 budget shall be no more than 7,289 tons.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2905.01); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
